  "description": "BOLSOM crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C88 H126 Mn3 N10 O34 Tb4,6(C2 H3 N1). From the CIF bond table, Tb1 (Tb) has 6 O neighbors; Tb2 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Mn1 (Mn) has 6 O neighbors; Mn2 (Mn) has 4 O neighbors; Tb1A (Tb) has 6 O neighbors; Tb2A (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Mn2A (Mn) has 4 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 8 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.196-3.597 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 86.56-103.69°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C100H144Tb4Mn3N16O34. Article name explicitly identifies Mn(III), Tb(III).",
